1
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,640
Half a year ago,
mifepristone and misoprostol,

2
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,920
also known as abortion pills,

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,920
were purchased
under your real-name account.

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,120
Li Ran suffered a miscarriage

5
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,080
because she accidentally
took these two pills.

6
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,610
Do you have anything to say?

7
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,800
What does that have to do with me?

8
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,160
What evidence do you have to prove

9
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:28,200
that the pills she took
were the ones I bought?

10
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,060
Half a year ago,

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,280
someone saw you personally
hand that opened bottle of vitamins

12
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,560
to Li Ran.

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,600
Li Ran then posted about it
on social media.

14
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,960
The batch number
of that bottle of vitamins

15
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,280
perfectly matches

16
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,820
the one you bought.

17
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,360
She sent the vitamins for testing
immediately after her miscarriage.

18
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:48,090
We found a large amount
of abortion pills inside.

19
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:06,520
I made a foolish mistake before.

20
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,539
But we've already made up.

21
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,280
She not only forgave me,

22
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,720
but also agreed to be my bridesmaid

23
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,180
and witness my happiness.

24
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,840
Let's change the subject.

25
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:17,800
On March 7th,

26
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,440
Wei Feng called you twice.

27
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:21,090
What did you talk about?

28
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,320
Just some routine check-ins.

29
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,600
The police have asked this before.

30
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,930
The specific details are in my testimony.

31
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,280
He called you

32
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,440
at 7:23 PM,

33
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:35,479
and you only talked for a minute.

34
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,240
What exactly did you talk about?

35
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,280
I was about to watch a movie
with my mom that day,

36
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,880
so I didn't have time to chat.

37
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,170
You go ahead.

38
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:42,640
I need to take this.

39
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,240
All right.

40
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,000
What are you up to?

41
00:01:47,759 --> 00:01:49,240
I was looking at some clothes

42
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,400
and ordered a few outfits for you too.

43
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,400
Thank you, honey.

44
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,530
You're so good to me.

45
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,440
I'm so lucky to have married you.

46
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,000
Glad you know.

47
00:01:58,039 --> 00:01:58,880
I gotta go.

48
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:00,340
My movie is about to start.

49
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,640
That was pretty much it.

50
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,320
Just some daily updates.

51
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:04,940
I blame myself.

52
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:08,449
I should have noticed
something was wrong with him earlier.

53
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,720
Here is the ticket stub from that night.

54
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,650
You can check the payment records.

55
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,730
You kept a ticket stub
from two months ago.

56
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:24,720
Ms. Han,

57
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,680
you are very thoughtful.

58
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:29,410
I have a habit of collecting ticket stubs.

59
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:33,440
Please prepare all your ticket stubs
from the past three years

60
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,500
and send them to us.

61
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,490
But it might take some time.

62
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:40,280
After all,

63
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,010
I moved after getting married.

64
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,060
Let's call it a day.

65
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,280
I hope you think carefully about

66
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,810
everything you said today.

67
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,720
She's getting a little flustered.

68
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:00,560
She remembers the call logs
from two months ago so clearly,

69
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,760
matching Wei Feng's statement
word for word.

70
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,560
They must have

71
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,490
colluded on their stories.

72
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,360
She was so eager to prove her innocence

73
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,620
that she lost her cool.

74
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,210
I think she'll still need some time

75
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,770
to get three years' worth of ticket stubs.

76
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,400
Tell you what.

77
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,720
I'll contact Captain Zheng first

78
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,850
to double-check Han Jiatong's alibi.

79
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,960
Why are you stammering?

80
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:21,930
I'm fine.

81
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:23,360
I'm ok.

82
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,640
I just wanted

83
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,180
to hear your voice.

84
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,200
What's going on?

85
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,200
Tell me the truth.

86
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,440
I'm in trouble.

87
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,560
Li Ran is dead.

88
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,760
I don't know

89
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,360
what to do.

90
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,700
Come over quickly.

91
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,520
Help

92
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:40,600
me.

93
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,450
What did you say?

94
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:44,300
Say that again.

95
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:48,000
I can't hide it

96
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,920
anymore.

97
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,079
Feng did do something stupid.

98
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,140
Why did you keep it from me?

99
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:00,180
If you had told me earlier,

100
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,860
would it have come to this?

101
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,820
The prosecutors are already suspecting me.

102
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:06,600
I was completely dragged
into this by Feng.

103
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,400
Shut up.

104
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,180
I don't want to hear it.

105
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,720
Dad, I'm begging you.

106
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,050
I'm really begging you.

107
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,160
Even if it's not for me,

108
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,220
you can't just sit back and do nothing

109
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,760
for your grandson's sake.

110
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:21,959
Grandson?

111
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,500
When did you get pregnant?

112
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,860
I secretly went for a checkup a while ago.

113
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,440
In my belly

114
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,500
is your biological grandson,

115
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,120
the only heir of the Wei family.

116
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:36,320
Feng's suspicion can't be cleared now.

117
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,850
You have to think about your grandson.

118
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,970
Are you using the child to threaten me?

119
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,960
I really have no other choice.

120
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,370
He tricked me into going
to Li Ran's house.

121
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,060
When I arrived,

122
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,460
Feng was already dismembering the body.

123
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,900
The child is innocent.

124
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,610
I'm begging you.

125
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,120
At least give him a chance

126
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,760
to call you grandpa.

127
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,240
I'm begging you.

128
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,200
I'm really begging you, Dad.

129
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,960
Go get ready first.

130
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:14,060
Hurry up and go.

131
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,320
I don't care whose baby she's carrying.

132
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,930
I'm only protecting my son.

133
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,210
You think I want to protect her?

134
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,480
Then

135
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,159
why did you send her away?

136
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:47,659
If I don't protect her,

137
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,320
she'll testify against Xiaofeng

138
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,880
to save herself.

139
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,530
Think of something, quick.

140
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,120
I'm willing to pay any price

141
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,880
to save our son.

142
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,840
What's the use of saying that now?

143
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,200
Honey,

144
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,200
we just have to risk it all.

145
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,160
What's wrong?

146
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,140
The police.

147
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,400
Got it.

148
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,240
Thanks for your hard work.

149
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,040
Han Jiatong tried to flee last night

150
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,040
but was stopped by the police.

151
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,560
She has already been interrogated.

152
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,400
Since she's pregnant,

153
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:41,000
she's currently out on bail.

154
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,500
She actually tried to run?

155
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:43,840
There's new evidence.

156
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,000
There's a problem
with Han Jiatong's alibi.

157
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,360
Surveillance shows

158
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,620
she left for 22 minutes during the movie.

159
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,040
Our intuition was right.

160
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:51,080
Kaixin,

161
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,610
show the files to everyone.

162
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:57,480
Everyone, please
take a look at these files.

163
00:06:57,480 --> 00:07:00,160
After Han Jiatong made
the fragrance at this shop,

164
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,690
she drove to Li Ran's house.

165
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,010
Fragrance shop?

166
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,760
Li Ran had a level-four allergic reaction.

167
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,880
Cinnamaldehyde, lavender, and rose oil

168
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:07,740
are all spices.

169
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,320
So, Prosecutor Fang,

170
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,520
you suspect Han Jiatong

171
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:13,760
specially made a fragrance that would
trigger Li Ran's allergies and gave it to her?

172
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,760
You finally hit the nail on the head.

173
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,680
Then what was her motive for doing this?

174
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,560
She didn't want Li Ran
to attend her wedding.

175
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,160
That was her initial motive.

176
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,320
Bold but reasonable.

177
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,010
Zhou Yan,

178
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,760
sync the clues with the police

179
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,560
and verify them as soon as possible.

180
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,760
Good work, everyone.

181
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:29,880
Prosecutor Qiao,

182
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,140
No need.

183
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,840
It seems setting up
this joint investigation team

184
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,100
was highly necessary.

185
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,450
Your thinking is clear,

186
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:36,920
bold,

187
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:37,840
and straightforward.

188
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,570
And the results are immediate.

189
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,480
Good news.

190
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:44,440
The murder weapon has been found at the
foot of the mountain near the dump site.

191
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,360
The police are conducting further tests.

192
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,920
We'll have the results soon.

193
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,960
Stay humble

194
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,520
and keep up the good work.

195
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:50,850
Okay.

196
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,680
Okay.

197
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,120
They found the murder weapon.

198
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:01,680
No fingerprints were found on the knife
during the initial check.

199
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:04,610
But Han Jiatong is being investigated
by the police.

200
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,120
Mr. Wei,

201
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:11,560
are you sure the baby
Han Jiatong is carrying is yours?

202
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,200
Attorney Qin,

203
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,010
what do you mean?

204
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,160
Even if the baby is yours,

205
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,600
can you guarantee

206
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:21,130
Han Jiatong won't push
all the blame onto you?

207
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,380
You are your parents' only child.

208
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,880
You need to think it through.

209
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,540
Do you want to save Han Jiatong

210
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,200
or yourself?

211
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,260
Why are you here again?

212
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,280
Your lawyer

213
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:39,010
should have told you
the murder weapon was found.

214
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,120
The police detected your blood sample

215
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,120
in the crevices of the knife handle,

216
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,000
and Li Ran's DNA

217
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:47,360
on the blade.

218
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:49,410
Do you have anything to say?

219
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,810
Do you remember the gloves you wore

220
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:57,480
when dismembering the body?

221
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,720
The worn areas of the gloves...

222
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,720
It perfectly matches

223
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,000
the abrasion on the webbing
of your right hand.

224
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,120
That was when

225
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,520
the blood seeped into the gap.

226
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,200
At 7:23 p.m. that night,

227
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:12,000
you had a phone call with Han Jiatong.

228
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:12,880
What did you talk about?

229
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:13,880
Tell us in detail.

230
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:16,100
I've repeated this over and over.

231
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:18,120
Haven't I told you several times already?

232
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,920
We strongly suspect
that you lied in your statement

233
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:22,000
and colluded

234
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,360
with Han Jiatong.

235
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,760
Did you know

236
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:29,650
Li Ran had a miscarriage last October?

237
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,960
Han Jiatong was the one

238
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,760
who caused it.

239
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,660
I didn't know that.

240
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,930
All the evidence points to you now.

241
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,360
Even if you don't confess,

242
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,000
we can

243
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,000
prosecute you with zero confession

244
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,920
if the chain of evidence is sufficient.

245
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:44,000
Based on your act of murder
and dismemberment,

246
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,080
you could face the death penalty.

247
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,160
I confess.

248
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,160
Honey,

249
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,890
calm down first.

250
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,300
You're getting married soon.

251
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:57,010
You're going to be a father.

252
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,760
You have to deal with this properly.

253
00:09:58,760 --> 00:09:59,820
Do you understand?

254
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,880
How should I handle it?

255
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,440
Break it into pieces.

256
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:06,880
Break it into pieces.

257
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,240
Break it into pieces.

258
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,640
Break it into pieces.

259
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,080
Don't delete tonight's call logs.

260
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,740
It was just a normal greeting.

261
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,080
I'll handle

262
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:17,840
the security cameras in the neighborhood.

263
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,570
Don't worry.

264
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:19,610
Okay,

265
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,640
I got it.

266
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,140
You said Han Jiatong was at the scene.

267
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,840
That's just your side of the story.

268
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,440
Do you have any other evidence?

269
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,040
Let me

270
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,360
think...

271
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:30,810
She seemed to be wearing...

272
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,120
You're finally here.

273
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,440
We were doing it,

274
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,480
and then...

275
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,570
she suddenly started gasping,

276
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,520
telling me to...

277
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:47,040
I thought she was just excited.

278
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,840
But then she just died.

279
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,360
But I did what you said...

280
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:53,680
Look.

281
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,440
Got it.

282
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,900
Since I came back tonight,

283
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,900
I'm in the same boat as you.

284
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,400
But honey,

285
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,360
I'm carrying our child.

286
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,440
You can't let him grow up without a father

287
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,360
and a mother.

288
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,040
So remember,

289
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,880
I was never here tonight.

290
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:22,020
This has nothing to do with me
from beginning to end.

291
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,480
That way,

292
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:25,080
even if the body is found,

293
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:26,640
I can cover for you

294
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,930
and keep things under control.

295
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,240
I

296
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,440
trust you.

297
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,040
Go.

298
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,560
Let me check.

299
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:40,080
Remember to take your clothes off.

300
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,410
Don't get blood on them.

301
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,040
You're back.

302
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,720
This is a screenshot
from the mall's surveillance.

303
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,720
It confirms that

304
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,680
Han Jiatong's outfit
on the night of the crime

305
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:55,540
matches Wei Feng's description.

306
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:57,200
Based on the surveillance time,

307
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,200
she really didn't have time
to change clothes.

308
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,860
This evidence is admissible.

309
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,200
That means

310
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,720
Han Jiatong went to Li Ran's house

311
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,520
and met Wei Feng during that time

312
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,060
on the day of the crime.

313
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:09,400
She's out on bail pending trial.

314
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,530
Let's see her again.

315
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,050
Okay.

316
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,360
I'll get Zhou Yan.

317
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,600
This is the day of the crime.

318
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,680
Captured by the mall's surveillance.

319
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:20,080
You were wearing the clothes
you just bought that day, right?

320
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,560
It's just a piece of clothing.

321
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:22,760
What does that prove?

322
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,760
We checked the surveillance
and your purchase history.

323
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:30,040
You were wearing exactly
what you bought at the mall that day.

324
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:32,040
If you hadn't been to Li Ran's house,

325
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:34,770
how would Wei Feng know
what you were wearing?

326
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,400
Wei Feng even changed his story.

327
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,130
Can you trust

328
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:39,920
his words?

329
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,960
There's no use hiding it.

330
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,640
Your car's navigation system

331
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,700
will reveal everywhere you've been.

332
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,100
Li Ran died right in front of Wei Feng.

333
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,780
I'm not the killer.

334
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,610
Why would I go there?

335
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:57,170
To retrieve the perfume
left at Li Ran's house...

336
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:14,840
We found records

337
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,080
of you making perfume

338
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,880
at the DIY shop.

339
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,520
The ingredients you used

340
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,200
could all trigger Li Ran's allergies.

341
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,320
And Li Ran's death

342
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:25,180
was caused precisely
by an allergic asthma attack.

343
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,720
I didn't mean to kill her.

344
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:29,160
I

345
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:31,440
just wanted to teach her a lesson.

346
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,240
I wanted to trigger her allergies

347
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,170
so she wouldn't attend my wedding.

348
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,120
I really never thought she would die.

349
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:38,440
I didn't know Wei Feng
would do something like that.

350
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,720
If you really have a clear conscience,

351
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:42,520
why did you take the fragrance
from Li Ran's place?

352
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,730
Did you have anything to do with

353
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:48,840
destroying the surveillance footage
in Li Ran's neighborhood?

354
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,440
You bear an undeniable responsibility

355
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,880
for Li Ran's death.

356
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,080
Not answering

357
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,410
won't change anything.

358
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:55,640
Ms. Xu,

359
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:56,600
let's go.

360
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:57,490
Okay.

361
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,570
Will I be sentenced?

362
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,040
I admit

363
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:16,240
I destroyed the surveillance footage.

364
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,060
I wore oversized men's shoes,

365
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,800
used a voice changer,

366
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,570
and bribed the security guard.

367
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:33,330
But I really never wanted her dead.

368
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,580
When I arrived,

369
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:40,580
Wei Feng was already
dismembering the body.

370
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,920
This was sent

371
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,120
to the courtyard early this morning.

372
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:47,980
It reports Prosecutor Xu Yishan
for taking bribes.

373
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:53,920
Isn't this Lawyer Qin?

374
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,170
Why did you meet?

375
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,240
Yishan reported this situation

376
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,320
to the office that very day.

377
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:04,250
She also handed in an audio recording
and a bank card,

378
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:06,320
containing 880,000 in cash.

379
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:09,120
The other party promised
to solve her child's schooling issue.

380
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,320
The office has already verified it.

381
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:12,320
There is absolutely no bribery involved.

382
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,180
This Wei Qishan

383
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,940
is full of crooked tricks.

384
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:15,760
Look,

385
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,200
I don't know where he got my number,

386
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,460
but he calls every day.

387
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,610
Then just block him.

388
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:23,640
Out of sight, out of mind.

389
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:24,760
I wish I could.

390
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,880
Wei Qishan made his fortune quite early.

391
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:29,960
He has certain business resources
in our city,

392
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,880
and knows quite a few people
in various industries.

393
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,120
I'm under a lot of pressure

394
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:33,980
with this case.

395
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:35,370
Don't worry.

396
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,000
Fang Wei is the sharpest prosecutor

397
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,200
in our office.

398
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,040
She will definitely handle this case well.

399
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:41,680
Fang Wei

400
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,170
is too rigid,

401
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,560
which makes her vulnerable.

402
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:45,120
I want you

403
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,640
to take the lead on this case.

404
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:50,880
It wouldn't be appropriate
for me to step in now,

405
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:51,520
would it?

406
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:54,010
She can't handle Wei Qishan's tricks.

407
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:55,840
You and Fang Wei need to work together,

408
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,360
one in the open,

409
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:56,960
one in the dark,

410
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:57,420
as spear

411
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:58,220
and shield,

412
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,000
to handle this case well.

413
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:03,560
I'll follow the office's arrangement.

414
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:07,050
Haven't you always wanted to know
what I was up to?

415
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:07,810
Now you know.

416
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,530
Why are you quiet again?

417
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,920
How was I supposed to know

418
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,180
things were like this?

419
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:14,620
I told you long ago,

420
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:16,760
the world isn't what you think it is.

421
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,400
What about Lawyer Qin?

422
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,160
The case has been investigated.

423
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:24,120
Relevant clues have been provided
to the Justice Bureau.

424
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,320
He has been dealt with
according to the law.

425
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:28,040
Bringing out the surveillance footage now

426
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:30,100
is just to obstruct our prosecution.

427
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:31,720
Don't let it affect you.

428
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,800
Just do your job.

429
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,360
Attorney Qin,

430
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,040
what took you so long?

431
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:38,800
The trial

432
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:39,920
is tomorrow.

433
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:41,170
I'm a nervous wreck.

434
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:42,960
What exactly is going on?

435
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:44,440
Chairman Wei,

436
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:45,850
I've been reported.

437
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:48,160
I'm under investigation
by the judicial authorities.

438
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,200
I can't help you

439
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,260
with the case anymore.

440
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:53,680
Attorney Qin!

441
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:56,360
Wei,

442
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,090
you have to think of something!

443
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,120
What can I do?

444
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:04,200
Okay,

445
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:04,880
I got it.

446
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,530
The police are here for you.

447
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,560
The defendant, Wei Feng,

448
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:14,000
has violated

449
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:17,520
Article 236,

450
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:19,760
Paragraph 3, Item 6 of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

451
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:21,119
constituting the crime of rape.

452
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:23,920
He also dismembered
and disposed of the body,

453
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,680
using extremely cruel methods

454
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,319
and under particularly
egregious circumstances.

455
00:17:27,319 --> 00:17:29,560
It is recommended that he be sentenced
to life imprisonment

456
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,440
and deprived of political rights for life.

457
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,200
The defendant, Han Jiatong,

458
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,560
has violated

459
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:36,560
Article 310,

460
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:39,160
Paragraph 1 of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

461
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,720
constituting the crime of harboring.

462
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:43,160
She has violated Article 307,

463
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:45,680
Paragraph 2 of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

464
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:47,600
constituting the crime of helping
to destroy evidence.

465
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:50,120
She has violated Article 302

466
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:52,080
of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China.

467
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:54,280
It constitutes the crime
of intentionally destroying a corpse.

468
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:56,240
According to Paragraph 1, Article 69

469
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:58,520
of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

470
00:17:58,520 --> 00:18:01,640
a sentence of six years
in prison is recommended.

471
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,280
Wei!

472
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:12,060
Why are you in my house?

473
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,720
Yishan gave me the key.

474
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:18,170
She said she wanted me to surprise you.

475
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:18,640
How is it?

476
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:19,700
Are you surprised?

477
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:28,640
You can stay here,

478
00:18:28,640 --> 00:18:30,320
but we need to set some ground rules.

479
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,920
First, do not disturb my work.

480
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,120
Second, no bringing men home.

481
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:33,600
Third,

482
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:35,120
no snoring.
